{"unit_id":"NONEMIN__dsh-sidebar-panels#card-zh","repo":"NONEMIN/dsh-sidebar-panels","commit":"e75f1e2a9dc2399310200957c977185893219441","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的侧边栏管理插件，在设置→通用中集中列出已注册的全局面板。用户可以隐藏或恢复面板、拖动调整顺序，也能在侧栏中右键隐藏；设置弹窗还提供开关、上下移动、全部显示和恢复默认顺序。插件将状态保存在本机，并与 dsh-context、dsh-search-index、dsh-market 和 dsh-armory 的原生侧栏开关同步。适合希望整理 DSH 左侧面板、统一控制插件入口的用户；不需要 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:911-1125","client.js:644-720","index.js:9-17"]}
{"unit_id":"NONEMIN__dsh-sidebar-panels#card-en","repo":"NONEMIN/dsh-sidebar-panels","commit":"e75f1e2a9dc2399310200957c977185893219441","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels manages global panels in the DSH Web sidebar from Settings → General. Hide or restore entries, drag to reorder them, use right-click to hide, and synchronize supported plugins' native switches. State is stored locally. No API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:911-1125","client.js:644-720","index.js:9-17"]}
