{"unit_id":"NONEMIN__dsh-sidebar-panels#feature-manage","repo":"NONEMIN/dsh-sidebar-panels","commit":"e75f1e2a9dc2399310200957c977185893219441","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels 的功能「集中管理面板」：在设置→通用中列出当前已注册的全局面板，并显示已隐藏项目数量。点击管理按钮打开设置弹窗，统一查看和操作各项。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1128-1164","client.js:1272-1282"]}
{"unit_id":"NONEMIN__dsh-sidebar-panels#feature-visibility","repo":"NONEMIN/dsh-sidebar-panels","commit":"e75f1e2a9dc2399310200957c977185893219441","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels 的功能「显示与隐藏」：在管理弹窗切换面板开关，或在侧栏面板图标上右键选择隐藏；Show all 可恢复全部显示，设置会保存到本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:694-720","client.js:881-892","index.js:9-17"]}
{"unit_id":"NONEMIN__dsh-sidebar-panels#feature-reorder","repo":"NONEMIN/dsh-sidebar-panels","commit":"e75f1e2a9dc2399310200957c977185893219441","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels 的功能「面板排序」：在侧栏图标间拖放，或在管理弹窗拖动条目、使用上下箭头移动。新顺序会写入状态，并用于排列左侧面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:706-735","client.js:762-809","client.js:948-1010"]}
{"unit_id":"NONEMIN__dsh-sidebar-panels#feature-sync","repo":"NONEMIN/dsh-sidebar-panels","commit":"e75f1e2a9dc2399310200957c977185893219441","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels 的功能「原生开关同步」：管理页切换指定插件面板时写回其公开设置或存储；检测到原生开关关闭时，也会同步更新本插件的隐藏状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:455-463","client.js:589-624","client.js:644-699"]}
{"unit_id":"NONEMIN__dsh-sidebar-panels#caveat-local","repo":"NONEMIN/dsh-sidebar-panels","commit":"e75f1e2a9dc2399310200957c977185893219441","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels 使用前须知：面板状态写入 ~/.dsh/sidebar-panels.json，诊断日志写入 ~/.dsh/logs/sidebar-panels.log。（见 index.js:9-17、54-62）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:9-17","index.js:37-62"]}
